Verse 1:
[C]O God, [F]our [C]help [Am]in [Dm7]a [G]ges [C]past, Our [Am]hope [Em]for [Am]years [D]to [G]come,
[G]Our [C]shel[F]ter [Dm]from [G]the [C]storm[F]y [E]blast, [C]And [Dm]our [C]e[Dm]ter[G]nal [C]home!

Verse 2:
[C][F]Under [C][Am]the [Dm7][G]shadow [C][Am]of [Em][Am]thy [D][G]throne,
[G][C][F]still [Dm][G][C]may [F][E][C]we [Dm][C][Dm]dwell [G][C]secure;
[C][F][C]sufficient [Am][Dm7]is [G][C][Am]thine [Em][Am]arm [D][G]alone,
[G][C][F]and [Dm][G][C]our [F][E][C]defense [Dm][C][Dm]is [G][C]sure.

Verse 3:
[C][F]Before [C][Am]the [Dm7][G]hills [C][Am]in [Em][Am]order [D][G]stood,
[G][C][F]or [Dm][G][C]earth [F][E][C]received [Dm][C][Dm]her [G][C]frame,
[C][F][C]from [Am][Dm7]everlasting, [G][C][Am]thou [Em][Am]art [D][G]God,
[G][C][F]to [Dm][G][C]endless [F][E][C]years [Dm][C][Dm]the [G][C]same.

Verse 4:
[C][F]A [C][Am]thousand [Dm7][G]ages, [C][Am]in [Em][Am]thy [D][G]sight,
[G][C][F]are [Dm][G][C]like [F][E][C]an [Dm][C][Dm]evening [G][C]gone;
[C][F]short [C]as [Am][Dm7]the [G]watch [C][Am]that [Em]ends [Am][D]the [G]night,
[G][C][F][Dm]before [G][C][F]the [E][C][Dm][C]rising [Dm][G][C]sun.

Verse 5:
[C][F]O [C][Am]God, [Dm7][G]our [C]help [Am][Em]in [Am][D]ages [G]past,
[G][C][F]our [Dm][G]hope [C][F]for [E][C][Dm]years [C][Dm]to [G][C]come;
[C][F]be [C]thou [Am][Dm7]our [G]guide [C][Am]while [Em]life [Am][D]shall [G]last,
[G][C][F][Dm]and [G][C][F]our [E][C][Dm][C]eternal [Dm][G][C]home!
